        "description": "A female knight who served the Illdoren Kingdom as Commander of the Eastern Expeditionary Force, she is the eldest daughter of the noble Lavillant family.\n\nSkilled in combat, she can even fight multiple opponents at once, and hold her own against opponents with greater physical strength than her. Her family attempted to arrange marriages for her, but she grew frustrated at the role she was expected to take as a married woman, and beat all of her would-be husbands in duels.",
